# FIRE_WAVE replaces the above blast fields. Source1000.148 emits1000.147:
# every2frames advance30native units; shrink by.03*frame; stop afterframe28.
# Jets live20frames, damage only onframes2/4. Sprite scale does not scale damage radius.
# stepFrames,spacing,count,lifeFrames,pulseA,pulseB,radius,monster/player damage,scaleLossPerStep.
lob_fire_wave 87.1.0 2 3 14 20 2 4 2 32 10 .06

# Native FIRE and EXPLOSION channels, excluding friendly/player/familiar sources
